          ]
        },
        "150040104": {
          "id": 150040104,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1002,
          "text": "什么情况？",
          "next": [
            150040105
          ]
        },
        "150040105": {
          "id": 150040105,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "我俩没事，但逛街时遇上一个自称「火花」的家伙",
          "next": [
            150040106
          ]
        },
        "150040106": {
          "id": 150040106,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "她宣称要干掉我和{NICKNAME}，把列车组排除在幻月游戏外",
          "next": [
            150040107
          ]
        },
        "150040107": {
          "id": 150040107,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "那咱们可得加快行动啦",
          "next": [
            150040108
          ]
        },
        "150040108": {
          "id": 150040108,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "所以，你们做好决定了？",
          "next": [
            150040109
          ]
        },
        "150040109": {
          "id": 150040109,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "我是有点想法，虽然不知道{NICKNAME}怎么想",
          "next": [
            150040110
          ]
        },
        "150040110": {
          "id": 150040110,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 8000,
          "text": "我对参与幻月游戏有兴趣",
          "next": [
            150040111
          ]
        },
        "150040111": {
          "id": 150040111,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 8000,
          "text": "我一直在想，如果赢了的话，我该用这权能做些什么，又或者我可以要求阿哈为我做些什么",
          "next": [
            150040112
          ]
        },
        "150040112": {
          "id": 150040112,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 8000,
          "text": "有空我和大家详细聊聊",
          "next": [
            150040113
          ]
        },
        "150040113": {
          "id": 150040113,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "丹恒那边怎么样？@丹恒",
          "next": [
            150040114
          ]
        },
        "150040114": {
          "id": 150040114,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1002,
          "text": "我联络上了仙舟特使，但他们也遇到了一些问题，想寻求帮助。",
          "next": [
            150040115
          ]
        },
        "150040115": {
          "id": 150040115,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1002,
          "text": "我和星期日正在路上。",
          "next": [
            150040116
          ]
        },
        "150040116": {
          "id": 150040116,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1002,
          "text": "如果有需要，记得联系我。",
          "next": [
            150040117
          ]
        },
        "150040117": {
          "id": 150040117,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "好，姬子，接下来我们要做什么？",
          "next": [
            150040118
          ]
        },
        "150040118": {
          "id": 150040118,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我想拜托你们去「绘世学院」，我的母校",
          "next": [
            150040119
          ]
        },
        "150040119": {
          "id": 150040119,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "【绘世学院的位置】",
          "next": [
            150040120
          ]
        },
        "150040120": {
          "id": 150040120,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "这所学校里，有一位名叫啵啵娃的老师",
          "next": [
            150040121
          ]
        },
        "150040121": {
          "id": 150040121,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "她是我的朋友，保管着加入「幻月游戏」所需的面具",
          "next": [
            150040122
          ]
        },
        "150040122": {
          "id": 150040122,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "为避免夜长梦多，你们先找到她，接过面具",
          "next": [
            150040123
          ]
        },
        "150040123": {
          "id": 150040123,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "咱们这就走",
